 need to select 6 (for 6h/06:00) and confirm with OK.\\nStep 10: Action selected: {\\\"action_type\\\": \\\"click\\\", \\\"index\\\": 25}. Clicked on \\\"6\\\" in the hour clock face to set the start hour to 6; the picker now shows hour as \\\"06\\\" and advanced to the minute selection view (00 minutes selected). Next, keep minutes at 00 and click OK to confirm 6:00 start time.\\nStep 11: Action selected: {\\\"action_type\\\": \\\"click\\\", \\\"index\\\": 4}. Clicked OK to confirm the start time of 06:00 on Monday October 16; returned to the New Event screen showing title, description, and start/end times both at 06:00 \\u2014 still need to change end time to 06:45.\\nStep 12: Action selected: {\\\"action_type\\\": \\\"click\\\", \\\"index\\\": 10}. Clicked on end time field (06:00) to open the time picker; a clock dial time picker appeared with 06 hours selected. Next, I need to change minutes to 45 by clicking the minute field and selecting 45, then tap OK.\\n\\nHere is a list of descriptions for some UI elements on the current screen:\\nUI element 0: UIElement(text='06', content_description='6 hours', class_name='android.view.View', bbox=None, bbox_pixels=BoundingBox(x_min=257, x_max=509, y_min=713, y_max=923), hint_text=None, is_checked=True, is_checkable=True, is_clickable=True, is_editable=False, is_enabled=True, is_focused=False, is_focusable=True, is_long_clickable=False, is_scrollable=False, is_selected=False, is_visible=True, package_name='com.simplemobiletools.calendar.pro', resource_name='com.simplemobiletools.calendar.pro:id/material_hour_tv', tooltip=None, resource_id=None, metadata=None)\\nUI element 1: UIElement(text='00', content_description='0 minutes', class_name='android.view.View', bbox=None, bbox_pixels=BoundingBox(x_min=572, x_max=824, y_min=713, y_max=923), hint_text=None, is_checked=False, is_checkable=True, is_clickable=True, is_editable=False, is_enabled=True, is_focused=False, is_focusable=True, is_long_clickable=False, is_scrollable=Fa