ould follow:\n301766:When given a user request, you will try to complete it step by step. At each step, a list of descriptions for most UI elements on the current screen will be given to you (each element can be specified by an index), together with a history of what you have done in previous steps. Based on these pieces of information and the goal, you must choose to perform one of the action in the following list (action description followed by the JSON format) by outputing the action in the correct JSON format.\n301779:The (overall) user goal/request is:In Simple Calendar Pro, create a calendar event for this Monday at 6h with the title 'Meeting with Bob' and the description 'We will understand annual budget. Remember to confirm attendance.'. The event should last for 45 mins.\n301780:Now I want you to summerize the latest step based on the action you pick with the reason and descriptions for the before and after (the action) screenshots.\n301781:Here is the description for the before screenshot:\n301782:UI element 0: UIElement(text='06', content_description='6 hours', class_name='android.view.View', bbox=None, bbox_pixels=BoundingBox(x_min=257, x_max=509, y_min=713, y_max=923), hint_text=None, is_checked=True, is_checkable=True, is_clickable=True, is_editable=False, is_enabled=True, is_focused=False, is_focusable=True, is_long_clickable=False, is_scrollable=False, is_selected=False, is_visible=True, package_name='com.simplemobiletools.calendar.pro', resource_name='com.simplemobiletools.calendar.pro:id/material_hour_tv', tooltip=None, resource_id=None, metadata=None)\n301783:UI element 1: UIElement(text='00', content_description='0 minutes', class_name='android.view.View', bbox=None, bbox_pixels=BoundingBox(x_min=572, x_max=824, y_min=713, y_max=923), hint_text=None, is_checked=False, is_checkable=True, is_clickable=True, is_editable=False, is_enabled=True, is_focused=False, is_focusable=True, is_long_clickable=False, is_scrollable=False, is_selected=False, is_vi